s into the second equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n{c}_{2}={b}_{1}+2(-{c}_{1}+2{c}_{2})\\,⟹\\,{b}_{1}=2{c}_{1}-3{c}_{2}.\n$$\n\nSince $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]$, we can write the vector $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =2{b}_{1}-3{b}_{2} \\\\  & =2(2{c}_{1}-3{c}_{2})-3(-{c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}) \\\\  & =4{c}_{1}-6{c}_{2}+3{c}_{1}-6{c}_{2} \\\\  & =7{c}_{1}-12{c}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365445 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365446 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365447 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365448 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365449 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1041 "selection" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1104 #edb/ref 17592186365448 13194139535773 true] [17592186365444 1110 #uuid "42e2561b-4fdf-54ae-a64b-692264302692" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365445 1034 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535773 true] [17592186365445 1111 #uuid "2273a3b7-7955-5e9c-8a76-20b0a45cb8d8" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365446 1034 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{7} \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365446 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535773 true] [17592186365446 1111 #uuid "0ed0e007-c62d-599d-b28b-0e3805f57417" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365447 1034 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365447 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535773 true] [17592186365447 1111 #uuid "4ea92aeb-d5ba-5ba6-8924-14d4d64b5b91" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365448 1034 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535773 true] [17592186365448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194